            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from diesel, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 50 kWth. The multioutput process "diesel, burned in cogen 50kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 50kWth, diesel, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 50kWth, diesel, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 34% for electricity and 53% for heat. The exergy factor is 1 for ectricity and 0.164 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.80 for electricity an 0.20 for heat.;
